    en: '© <span class="js-current-year"></span> Mancia Studios · <a href="../../">Back to portfolio</a> · <a href="../nyxmesh/">NyxMesh</a> · <a href="../boop/">Boop</a> · <a href="../guardalinha/">GuardaLinha</a>'
